sequenceDiagram
    actor I as Interviewer
    participant UI as Interviewer UI
    participant DB as Firebase DB
    I->>UI: View Assigned Interviews
    UI->>DB: Fetch Interview Data
    DB-->>UI: Interviews List
    I->>UI: Select Candidate
    UI->>DB: Fetch Candidate Details
    DB-->>UI: Resume & Details
    I->>UI: Submit Feedback & Score
    UI->>DB: Save Feedback
    DB-->>UI: Saved Confirmation
